      "description": "Pressurised straight run along +X, Z up. Nodes N1..N7 at x = 0, 2, ..., 12 m (y = z = 0), members M1..M6 between consecutive nodes, one section, closed at N1 and N7. S-1 (N1) and S-7 (N7) are rigid UZ restraints that are never candidates; G-1 (N1: UX, UY, RX) is the only axial restraint, so the run is free to grow; G-7 (N7: UY) completes the out-of-plane restraint. Candidates H-3 (N3, x = 4) and H-5 (N5, x = 8). Stored loads: F-1 -8000 N at N2, F-2 -6000 N at N4, F-3 -5000 N at N6, F-4 -10000 N at N4 (stored, included by no named case), F-5 +2000 N at N4, and PR-1 internal pressure 3.5 MPa on M1..M6. W includes F-1 x1, F-2 x1.5, F-3 x1, PR-1 x1 at 20 degC (the installation temperature). O1 (design) adds F-5 x0.25 at 260 degC with S-1 moved -0.012 m and S-7 moved +0.012 m. O2 has W's loads at 180 degC with S-1 moved +0.009 m and S-7 moved -0.009 m. weight_rigid: three equal 4 m spans with midspan loads 8000, 9000, 5000 N; three-moment equation 4 M2 + M3 = -(3L/8)(P1 + P2), M2 + 4 M3 = -(3L/8)(P2 + P3) gives M2 = -5400, M3 = -3900 N m and reactions S-1 2650, H-3 10225, H-5 7600, S-7 1525 N, independent of E, A and I. Force solves: the run with both candidates replaced by forces is a simply supported 12 m span (determinate), so each position is the settlement line plus the deflection of the case's net forces (zero for W's loads with the forces W); u_O2 is exact rational, u_O1 contains F-5's deflection 500 f(x, 6) with f(x, a) = b x (L^2 - b^2 - x^2)/(6 E I L), b = L - a, x <= a. Thermal growth and pressure act only along X and change no vertical quantity.",
